paragraph.content:
incorporate a
		  widely accepted, nonproprietary, searchable, platform-independent
		  computer-readable format;

include
		  unique  identifiers for Federal awards and entities receiving
		  Federal awards that can be consistently applied Government-wide;

subparagraph.content:
include a
		  combination of Federal contracts, grants, and subawards, the aggregate value of
		  which is not less than $1,000,000,000 and not more than $2,000,000,000;

clause.content:
consolidating
		  aspects of Federal financial reporting to reduce the costs to recipients of
		  Federal awards;

automating
		  aspects of Federal financial reporting to increase efficiency and reduce the
		  costs to recipients of Federal awards;
